          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.labomascus@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 06 2019 12:36:33 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p>Stryker’s AORN LEARN Scholarship program has provided $1.35 million dollars over the past 5 years in scholarships for nurses to attend the AORN EXPO and Conference.</p>\n<h3>AORN Global Surgical Conference &amp; Expo</h3>\n<p>The 2020 AORN Global Surgical Conference &amp; EXPO will be held March 28 – April 1 in Anaheim, CA. Stay tuned for scholarship information that will be made available this fall.&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\">$1,350,000+ in scholarships | 592 recipients</span></span></h4>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Nov 22 2019 12:38:06 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
